/// M30 HISTORY-043 "Registry complete: roots green".
/// Source: tests/baseline/baseline_test.go symbol
/// TestRegistryComplete (L155-217) plus registryFile
/// (L104-150).
/// Disposition: historical_candidate (this row pins the
/// TestRegistryComplete offline pact as reviewable Can
/// facts; the old Go check stays until the integrator
/// retires it after every linked row, variant,
/// environment and control has accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): the static guard spellings as
/// the green root: the test name, the registry type,
/// the loader plus root calls, the json file, every
/// refusal guard, the Stat call, the frozen five, the
/// Fatal call, and the refusal count.
/// ADAPTATION (recorded, with source lines): test-name
/// pins TestRegistryComplete (L155); type-name pins
/// registryFile (L104); loader-call pins loadJSON
/// (L158); root-call pins repoRoot (L156); json-file
/// pins registry.json (L158); task-guard pins the
/// reg.Task not-equal T01 spelling (L160); empty-guard
/// pins the len Cases is-zero spelling (L163);
/// dup-guard pins the empty-or-seen spelling (L168);
/// family-guard pins the family/workload pair spelling
/// (L172); prompt-guard pins the triple-empty spelling
/// (L175); fixture-guard pins the fixtures/run pair
/// spelling (L178); stat-call pins os.Stat (L182);
/// candidate-guard pins the pending/owner spelling
/// (L186); heldout-guard pins the id/rule/renames
/// spelling (L189); hidden-guard pins the len Checks
/// is-zero spelling (L192); hidden-one-guard pins the
/// id/kind/expect spelling (L196); trial-guard pins
/// !ok (L201); attempts-want pins int (5) from the
/// frozen attempts leg (L204); fatal-call pins
/// t.Fatalf (L161); fatal-count pins int (16) from
/// the refusal legs (L161/L164/L169/L174/L176/L179/
/// L183/L187/L190/L193/L197/L202/L205/L208/L211/
/// L214).
/// Facet map (static baseline): test-name pins
/// TestRegistryComplete (L155); type-name pins
/// registryFile (L104); loader-call pins loadJSON
/// (L158); root-call pins repoRoot (L156); json-file
/// pins registry.json (L158); task-guard pins not T01
/// (L160); empty-guard pins zero cases (L163);
/// dup-guard pins empty-or-seen (L168); family-guard
/// pins the pair (L172); prompt-guard pins the triple
/// (L175); fixture-guard pins the pair (L178);
/// stat-call pins os.Stat (L182); candidate-guard pins
/// pending plus owner (L186); heldout-guard pins the
/// triple (L189); hidden-guard pins zero checks
/// (L192); hidden-one-guard pins the triple (L196);
/// trial-guard pins !ok (L201); attempts-want pins 5
/// (L204); fatal-call pins t.Fatalf (L161);
/// fatal-count pins 16 (L161 through L214).
/// The doc facts live in
/// history-043-base-semantics.can; the run shape plus
/// diagnostics live in history-043-run-shape.can.
/// Variants: none (row lists zero variants; default
/// plus seeded drifts only).
/// Environment: one gate (Bun/Go/Git for T01 smoke or
/// generator when applicable); binds at P23, requires
/// [] now (offline only).
/// Logical gates SUITE/DOC/FILES/PROC/BUILD/WORK bind
/// at P23; no live run now. Accept gate P23 is unmet.
/// Timeout 120000ms is the offline default bound (no
/// Go timeout in this row; binds at P23 like the M11
/// no-gate rows).
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23
/// unmet).
/// Case history/registry-roots checks: test-name,
/// type-name, loader-call, root-call, json-file,
/// task-guard, empty-guard, dup-guard, family-guard,
/// prompt-guard, fixture-guard, stat-call,
/// candidate-guard, heldout-guard, hidden-guard,
/// hidden-one-guard, trial-guard, attempts-want,
/// fatal-call, fatal-count.
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later
